Dialogue: 4,0:01:20.80,0:01:23.15,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}現在之事  唯我行動
Dialogue: 4,0:01:23.15,0:01:25.50,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}自己之事  唯我知曉
Dialogue: 4,0:01:25.50,0:01:30.15,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}定將守護  你的一切
Dialogue: 4,0:01:30.15,0:01:35.00,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}伴你身旁  將你拯救
Dialogue: 4,0:01:35.00,0:01:36.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}面對不安
Dialogue: 4,0:01:36.90,0:01:39.55,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}強裝冷靜
Dialogue: 4,0:01:39.55,0:01:41.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}未來之事  唯我解決
Dialogue: 4,0:01:41.90,0:01:44.80,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}自己之事  唯我了解
